摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"agentmemory for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): full memory_* tools, capture hooks, and context injection over the local REST server","id":"gh:1333914823","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-agentmemory","slug":"elementor-i/dsh-agentmemory","topics":["agentmemory","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","memory"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"agentmemory for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): full memory_* tools, capture hooks, and context injection ov"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"er the local REST server"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-agentmemory"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**agentmemory for DeepSeek Harness** — full `memory_*` tools, automatic capture hooks, and opt-in co"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ntext injection over the local REST server."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"dsh-agentmemory connects agentmemory, a local memory server for coding agents, to DeepSeek Harness ("},{"id":"p5s2","text":"DSH). It exposes the full `memory_*` tool set, captures observations automatically from sessions, pr"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ompts, and tool activity, and can inject recalled context into the system prompt — all over the loca"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"l REST server, with no MCP bridge required."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Full tool surface** — all 54 `memory_*` tools (8 core) mapped to `/agentmemory/*`, plus `memory_"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"observe` and a `memory_http` escape hatch for any endpoint.\n- **Automatic capture** — session, promp"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"t, tool-use, subagent, workflow, and approval activity are recorded as observations in the backgroun"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"d.\n- **Context injection** — opt-in; recalled context from the session is added to the system prompt"},{"id":"p7s5","text":".\n- **Safe by default** — credential redaction, per-call timeouts, non-blocking observation, and des"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"tructive tools gated behind a flag.\n- **No MCP required** — no stdio bridge, no child process; the r"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"unning REST server (`localhost:3111`) is the only dependency."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"An agentmemory server running on the same machine (default `http://127.0.0.1:3111`, viewer on `3113`"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" agentmemory server running on the same machine (default `http://127.0.0.1:3111`, viewer on `3113`):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"If the server is unavailable, the plugin logs a warning and the `memory_*` tools return errors; the "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"harness itself keeps running normally."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Native mount"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Add an `insert` patch to `~/.dsh/config.yaml` (or `$DSH_HOME/cordis.patch.yml` for all profiles):"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Then restart DSH. Compiled output is committed, so no build step is required."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Official CLI"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Replace `web` with your profile name. The package declares a `dsh.bundle.patch`, so it loads as a pr"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ofile layer; compiled output is committed, so no build runs on install."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Plugin manager (AI-assisted)"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Oh-DSH-Desktop's plugin manager installs with an isolated preview and rollback. It is driven by an A"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"I coding agent through tools — not shell commands — so the fastest path is to paste this prompt to y"},{"id":"p22s3","text":" through tools — not shell commands — so the fastest path is to paste this prompt to your assistant:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> Install `dsh-agentmemory` from the Oh-DSH-Desktop plugin manager: refresh the plugin catalog, prep"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"are the install as an isolated preview, and apply it after I review the preview."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Under the hood the assistant calls these tools:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Notes:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- The plugin must already be in the public DSH catalog. The catalog is rebuilt hourly from GitHub re"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"pos tagged `dsh-plugin`, so a newly published repo appears within about an hour.\n- `desktop_plugin_a"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"pply` restarts the live DSH runtime — review the isolated preview before applying."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"All keys are optional and have safe defaults. The environment variables `AGENTMEMORY_URL`, `AGENTMEM"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ORY_SECRET`, and `AGENTMEMORY_PROJECT_NAME` are honored as fallbacks."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Key | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| `baseURL` | `http://127.0.0.1:3111` | agentmemory REST base URL |\n| `secret` | `\"\"` | Bearer secre"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"t (falls back to `AGENTMEMORY_SECRET`) |\n| `timeoutMs` | `10000` | per-tool HTTP timeout |\n| `observ"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"eTimeoutMs` | `3000` | hook observation timeout (fire-and-forget) |\n| `registerTools` | `true` | reg"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"ister the `memory_*` tool set |\n| `coreToolsOnly` | `false` | register only the 8 core tools |\n| `da"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"ngerousTools` | `false` | expose `governance_delete`, `heal`, `consolidate`, `reflect`, `crystallize"},{"id":"p32s6","text":"` |\n| `injectContext` | `false` | inject recalled context into the system prompt |\n| `healthCheck` |"},{"id":"p32s7","text":" `true` | warn on startup if the server is unreachable |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Hooks"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Activity is captured automatically through DSH's official events. Handlers are non-blocking: request"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"s use a short timeout and are never awaited, and waterfall events always call `next()`."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| agentmemory hook | DSH event | Mode |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| SessionStart | `session/created` | emit |\n| UserPromptSubmit | `agent/inbox/inserted` | emit |\n| P"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"reToolUse | `tools/pre-execute` | waterfall |\n| PostToolUse / PostToolUseFailure | `tools/result` | "},{"id":"p36s3","text":"ols/pre-execute` | waterfall |\n| PostToolUse / PostToolUseFailure | `tools/result` | emit |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Three parts cooperate over the local REST server:"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- **Tools** — each `memory_*` tool maps to the matching `/agentmemory/*` endpoint.\n- **Hooks** — DSH"},{"id":"p39s2","text":" lifecycle events are forwarded to the server as observations.\n- **Injection** — on session start, t"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"he server returns recalled context, which is added to the system prompt when `injectContext` is enab"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"erver returns recalled context, which is added to the system prompt when `injectContext` is enabled."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Tool names and endpoints follow agentmemory's official reference. A running server may differ from t"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"points follow agentmemory's official reference. A running server may differ from the latest release:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"- some features are disabled by default (for example `/slots` returns 503 with an enable hint);\n- ne"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"wer endpoints may not be present yet."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"On a 4xx or 5xx response, follow the hint in the response body or align the server version. `memory_"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"http` reaches endpoints without a dedicated tool."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"### The plugin manager fails to install — what else can I try?"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"Oh-DSH-Desktop's plugin manager and the official CLI both end up running `dsh plugin --profile <name"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"> add <package>`. If the plugin manager fails in your environment, the CLI is an equivalent fallback"},{"id":"p46s3","text":" add <package>`. If the plugin manager fails in your environment, the CLI is an equivalent fallback:"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"Replace `desktop` with your profile name, then restart DSH. If you are managing the desktop profile,"},{"id":"p48s2","text":" run the command with the same `DSH_HOME` the desktop app uses (on macOS, `~/Library/Application Sup"},{"id":"p48s3","text":"port/Oh-DSH-Desktop/dsh`)."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
